  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Come, and let us return unto the LORD: for he hath torn, and he will heal us; he hath smitten, and he will bind us up.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "After two days will he revive us: in the third day he will raise us up, and we shall live in his sight.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Then shall we know, if we follow on to know the LORD: his going forth is prepared as the morning; and he shall come unto us as the rain, as the latter and former rain unto the earth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "O Ephraim, what shall I do unto thee? O Judah, what shall I do unto thee? for your goodness is as a morning cloud, and as the early dew it goeth away.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Therefore have I hewed them by the prophets; I have slain them by the words of my mouth: and thy judgments are as the light that goeth forth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "For I desired mercy, and not sacrifice; and the knowledge of God more than burnt offerings.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "But they like men have transgressed the covenant: there have they dealt treacherously against me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Gilead is a city of them that work iniquity, and is polluted with blood.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "And as troops of robbers wait for a man, so the company of priests murder in the way by consent: for they commit lewdness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "I have seen an horrible thing in the house of Israel: there is the whoredom of Ephraim, Israel is defiled.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:hosea:6:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Also, O Judah, he hath set an harvest for thee, when I returned the captivity of my people.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hosea 6:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hosea:6:11"
      }
    }
  ],
